foundry-out/
cache/
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Broadcasts ARE committed: an Injective deploy that dies mid-run is replayed from
# broadcast/<script>/<chainId>/run-latest.json with `cast send`, never with --resume.
!broadcast/
broadcast/**/dry-run/

# 🔴 Safe proposals and collected signatures. SAFE_TX_DIR in the workspace's
# scripts/safe/safe-tx.sh DEFAULTS to `contracts/safe` — here, in the PUBLIC repo — so without
# this rule a `git add -A` publishes governance proposals and owner signatures. The workspace
# .gitignore carries a comment claiming its own `/contracts/` rule covers this; it does not,
# because that only stops the WORKSPACE repo tracking them. This is the rule that stops this one.
# Point SAFE_TX_DIR at the private workspace's own /safe/ instead.
/safe/
